```wireframe
board "Coffee Shop" accent=green
  screen phone "Checkout"
    navbar "Order" leading=back
    heading "Order Summary" level=2
    card padding=12
      stack gap=8
        text "Items" bold
        stack row gap=8 justify=between
          text "Cappuccino x2"
          text "$8.00"
        stack row gap=8 justify=between
          text "Croissant x1"
          text "$4.50"
        divider
        stack row gap=8 justify=between
          text "Total" bold
          text "$12.50" bold
    select "Payment method" value="Visa"
    toggle "Save card for future purchases"
    button primary "Pay $12.50" fullWidth
```
